{"unit_id":"zclDragon__dsh-side-chat#feature-lifecycle","repo":"zclDragon/dsh-side-chat","commit":"dc52bb74a7682a0921ad3c944e09f06107401847","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Side Chat 的功能「关闭与清理侧聊」：关闭单个或全部侧聊时释放对应 agent 并归档会话；父会话被 dispose 时也会级联清理其子侧聊。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/SideChatPanel.tsx:129-175","src/index.ts:281-337"]}
